    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": [
        "Now separate the features and target. We exclude Id because it is an identifier, not a meaningful property characteristic for this basic model.\n",
        "\n",
        "We will handle missing values and categorical columns inside a preprocessing pipeline. This is important because it allows the same transformations to be applied consistently to validation data and future houses."
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "id": "vrLE9DlBd791"
      }
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "source": [
        "assert train_df[\"SalePrice\"].notna().all()\n",
        "\n",
        "X = train_df.drop(columns=[\"SalePrice\", \"Id\"], errors=\"ignore\")\n",
        "y = train_df[\"SalePrice\"]\n",
        "\n",
        "print(\"Feature shape:\", X.shape)\n",
        "print(\"Target shape:\", y.shape)\n",
        "print(\"Numeric features:\", X.select_dtypes(include=\"number\").shape[1])\n",
        "print(\"Categorical features:\", X.select_dtypes(exclude=\"number\").shape[1])"
      ],
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "cKsq--f-zrT8",
        "outputId": "5298ab90-2b26-47d3-c64c-10d3c089e751"
