      "source": [
        "Step 11 — Compare your MLflow experiments. Interpret the results:\n",
        "- The first row has the lowest recorded RMSLE.\n",
        "- Compare Linear Regression against Random Forest.\n",
        "- Do not assume Random Forest will always win; use the measured validation results.\n",
        "- This comparison is only as reliable as the validation split. For a stronger final model, consider cross-validation and hyperparameter tuning."
      ],
